---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="The terms for using CalcYourFinance: our calculators are free estimation tools provided for informational purposes, not financial advice."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-[52rem] px-4 py-6 pb-16">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Terms & Conditions" }]} />
    <h1 class="my-5">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: {SITE.effectiveDate}.</p>
      <p>
        By using {SITE.domain} ("the Site") you agree to these terms. If you do not
        agree, please do not use the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Estimates, not financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators and content on this Site are provided for general
        informational and estimation purposes only. They do not constitute financial,
        accounting, tax, legal or professional advice. Fees, rates and formulas are
        estimates based on publicly available information and may not reflect your
        exact circumstances, negotiated rates, taxes, or a provider's latest pricing.
        Always verify figures with the relevant platform or a qualified professional
        before making decisions.
      </p>

      <h2>2. No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any
        kind, express or implied, including accuracy, completeness, fitness for a
        particular purpose, or uninterrupted availability. While we work hard to keep
        fee data correct and dated, we do not guarantee it is error-free or current.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} will not be liable for any
        loss or damage — including lost profits, mispricing, or any direct, indirect,
        incidental or consequential damages — arising from your use of, or reliance
        on, the Site or its calculators.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Third-party names and trademarks</h2>
      <p>
        Platform names such as Stripe, PayPal and Etsy are trademarks of their
        respective owners. We reference them only to identify the service a calculator
        relates to. {SITE.name} is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed
        by, or sponsored by any of these companies.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to misuse the Site, attempt to disrupt it, scrape it at a
        damaging scale, or use it for any unlawful purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The Site's design, text and code are owned by {SITE.name} unless otherwise
        noted. You may use the calculators for personal and business purposes but may
        not copy or republish the Site's content wholesale without permission.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms or the Site at any time. Continued use after changes
        means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
